From b8ad34b12068dc26cbb0b0f36d27a73793cf64d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:42:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(ui): accept Zigzag rest pockets in the rest group
 refusal test

PR #2037 made Zigzag legal for 2D rest machining (closing boundary
passes, #1490). The UI test from #1815 still expected the old Zigzag
refusal and turned main red. The test now asserts that Zigzag with rest
commits on Apply, and keeps the refusal asserts for Adaptive and for
pre-drilled entry.

Fixes #2302

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
